{
  "__comment": "File: shared/infrastructure/grafana/dashboards/grpc-red.json. Purpose: live gRPC RED placeholders for the six Person APIs. Queries use OTEL Prometheus-exporter names (opn_ prefix from collector namespace). Panels stay useful even before APIs export — they show No data rather than break Grafana.",
